stoljeće
# The locative singular the "u" preposition takes -- "u 20. stoljeću" ("in the
# 20th century"), the ordinary way to place an event in a century.  Distinct
# from the genitive plural "stoljeća" a bare count uses ("pet stoljeća"), so
# admitting it cannot admit a count.
# Hrvatski jezicni portal, stoljece, sklonidba (lokativ jd. "stoljecu").
stoljeću
